  "philosophyTitle": "Why Is the Window\nClosed Right Now?",
  "philosophyBody1": "Manifestation doesn't work on your schedule \u2014 it works on the moon's. The lunar cycle has specific windows where setting intentions is powerful, and periods where the most powerful thing you can do is nothing.",
  "philosophyBody2": "Right now, the moon is waning \u2014 shrinking toward darkness. This is the release phase. Your intentions from this cycle have been planted, tended, and offered in gratitude. Now they need space to take root. Pushing harder during this phase doesn't help. It interferes.",
  "philosophyBody3": "When the new moon arrives, the window opens again. That's when you set fresh intentions and begin a new cycle. The wait isn't wasted time \u2014 it's part of the practice. The discipline of release is what separates manifestation from wishing.",
  "philosophyDaysUntilOpen": "days until the window opens",
  "philosophyReminderSetFor": "Reminder set for {date}",
  "@philosophyReminderSetFor": {
    "placeholders": {
      "date": {
        "type": "String"
      }
    }
  },
  "philosophyRemindMe": "Remind me when it opens",
  "philosophyCouldNotSchedule": "Could not schedule reminder",
  "philosophyNotificationTitle": "The manifestation window is open.",
  "philosophyNotificationBody": "Set your intentions now.",
  "philosophyHookTitle": "What They Know\nThat You Don't",
  "philosophyHookBody1": "The most successful people on earth don't just set goals. They work with timing. They understand something most people never will: that the universe has a rhythm, and those who align with it don't chase results \u2014 results chase them.",
  "philosophyHookBody2": "This is not a secret. It is ancient knowledge \u2014 practiced for thousands of years by those who shaped empires, built dynasties, and quietly moved the world. The moon was their clock. \"I AM\" was their language. And commitment was their price.",
  "philosophyHookBody3": "Here is what they understood: manifestation is simple. Not easy \u2014 simple. You declare what you are becoming. You repeat it until your mind believes it. You give thanks before you see proof. And then you let go. Completely.",
  "philosophyHookBody4": "Most people fail because they won't commit to the process. They want the result without the discipline. They manifest for a day, check for signs, and quit when nothing happens by Tuesday. That is not manifestation. That is wishing.",
  "philosophyMoonHeading": "The Moon Is the Missing Piece",
  "philosophyMoonBody1": "You've probably tried affirmations before. You've probably said \"I am abundant\" in the mirror and felt nothing change. That's because you were speaking into dead air \u2014 no timing, no structure, no cosmic alignment behind your words.",
  "philosophyMoonBody2": "The moon changes everything. It gives your practice a cycle \u2014 a beginning, a middle, a peak, and a release. When you set intentions at the new moon, you're not just writing wishes. You're planting seeds in the only soil that has been moving oceans since before humans existed.",
  "philosophyMoonBody3": "The waning moon is not a pause. It is the most demanding phase of all. Anyone can ask. Anyone can repeat. But to release \u2014 to truly let go and trust that what you planted is growing in darkness \u2014 that requires the discipline this practice was built on.",
  "philosophyFourPhasesHeading": "The Four Sacred Phases",
  "philosophyPhasePlanting": "The Planting",
  "philosophyPhasePlantingDesc": "In darkness, you name what you need \u2014 not what you want, but what your soul requires. The new moon holds space for raw truth.",
  "philosophyPhaseTending": "The Tending",
  "philosophyPhaseTendingDesc": "As light returns, you repeat your intentions daily. Not as hope, but as certainty. You are not asking \u2014 you are remembering what is already on its way.",
  "philosophyPhaseGratitude": "The Gratitude",
  "philosophyPhaseGratitudeDesc": "At full illumination, you give thanks as though you already hold what you asked for. This is not pretending. This is the act that collapses the distance between where you are and where you are going.",
  "philosophyPhaseRelease": "The Release",
  "philosophyPhaseReleaseDesc": "And then \u2014 silence. You let go. You stop pushing, stop checking, stop asking. The waning moon teaches the hardest lesson: that your work is done, and now it belongs to something larger than you.",
  "philosophyClosing": "When the moon returns to darkness,\nyou begin.",

  "guideTitle": "How to Manifest",
  "guideIntro": "Four rules. That's all. Master these and the moon will do the rest.",
  "guideRule01": "RULE 01",
  "guideRule01Title": "Name the Need,\nNot the Want",
  "guideRule01Body1": "The surface desire masks the real intention. You don't actually want a million dollars \u2014 you want the feeling of safety, of freedom, of not worrying. Manifestation works on the level of feeling, not material objects.",
  "guideRule01Body2": "Ask yourself: why do I want this? The answer is your real intention.",
  "guideRule01Wrong1": "I want a million dollars",
  "guideRule01Right1": "I am experiencing financial freedom",
  "guideRule01Wrong2": "I want a partner",
  "guideRule01Right2": "I am surrounded by deep, loving connection",
  "guideRule01Wrong3": "I want a promotion",
  "guideRule01Right3": "I am recognized and valued for my work",
  "guideRule02": "RULE 02",
  "guideRule02Title": "I AM \u2014 The Most Powerful\nWords You'll Ever Speak",
  "guideRule02Body1": "In the Bible, when Moses asked God's name, the answer was \"I AM THAT I AM.\" Every tradition that has touched manifestation \u2014 from Hermetic philosophy to Neville Goddard to modern practice \u2014 treats \"I AM\" as the declaration that shapes reality.",
  "guideRule02Body2": "Whatever follows \"I AM\" becomes your command to the universe. Choose carefully.",
  "guideRule02Tip1": "Always positive \u2014 \"I am healthy\" not \"I am not sick\"",
  "guideRule02Tip2": "Always present tense \u2014 \"I am\" not \"I will be\"",
  "guideRule02Tip3": "Always with conviction \u2014 speak it as truth, not hope",
  "guideRule02Right1": "I am abundant and money flows to me easily",
  "guideRule02Right2": "I am at peace with who I am becoming",
  "guideRule02Right3": "I am worthy of the life I am creating",
  "guideRule03": "RULE 03",
  "guideRule03Title": "Speak As If\nIt's Already Done",
  "guideRule03Body1": "You don't need to know how it will happen. Your only job is to hold the vibration \u2014 the feeling \u2014 of already having what you declared.",
  "guideRule03Body2": "The universe doesn't respond to what you want. It responds to what you are. Don't chase. Don't check for signs. Just be it.",
  "guideRule03Wrong1": "I hope I'll find peace someday",
  "guideRule03Right1": "I am grateful for the peace that fills my life",
  "guideRule03Wrong2": "I'm trying to be more confident",
  "guideRule03Right2": "I am confident. I trust myself completely.",
  "guideRule04": "RULE 04",
  "guideRule04Title": "Gratitude Is the Proof",
  "guideRule04Body1": "Gratitude is not a thank-you note after the fact. It's the signal you send before you receive \u2014 proof to the universe that you trust the process.",
  "guideRule04Body2": "When you give thanks for something you haven't seen yet, you collapse the gap between wanting and having. This is the ceremony this app guides you through at every full moon.",
  "guideRule04Right1": "I am so grateful that financial freedom is my reality",
  "guideRule04Right2": "Thank you for the love that surrounds me every day",
  "guideRule04Right3": "I give thanks for my health, my strength, my clarity",
  "guideClosing": "This is your practice.\nThe moon provides the timing.\nYou provide the truth.",

