  "wisdom1": "What you seek is seeking you.",
  "wisdom1Author": "Rumi",
  "wisdom2": "The universe is not outside of you. Look inside yourself; everything that you want, you already are.",
  "wisdom2Author": "Rumi",
  "wisdom3": "Trust the wait. Embrace the uncertainty.",
  "wisdom4": "You don't attract what you want. You attract what you are.",
  "wisdom5": "When I let go of what I am, I become what I might be.",
  "wisdom5Author": "Lao Tzu",
  "wisdom6": "Nature does not hurry, yet everything is accomplished.",
  "wisdom6Author": "Lao Tzu",
  "wisdom7": "Assume the feeling of your wish fulfilled and observe the route that your attention follows.",
  "wisdom7Author": "Neville Goddard",
  "wisdom8": "Man's chief delusion is his conviction that there are causes other than his own state of consciousness.",
  "wisdom8Author": "Neville Goddard",
  "wisdom9": "You are always a student, never a master. You have to keep moving forward.",
  "wisdom9Author": "Conrad Hall",
  "wisdom10": "Stop acting so small. You are the universe in ecstatic motion.",
  "wisdom10Author": "Rumi",
  "wisdom11": "The present moment always will have been. Rest in that.",
  "wisdom12": "Letting go gives us freedom, and freedom is the only condition for happiness.",
  "wisdom12Author": "Thich Nhat Hanh",
  "wisdom13": "Surrender is not giving up. It is giving over to something greater.",
  "wisdom14": "You have within you right now, everything you need to deal with whatever the world can throw at you.",
  "wisdom14Author": "Brian Tracy",
  "wisdom15": "The quieter you become, the more you are able to hear.",
  "wisdom15Author": "Rumi",
  "wisdom16": "Your task is not to seek for love, but merely to seek and find all the barriers within yourself that you have built against it.",
  "wisdom16Author": "Rumi",
  "wisdom17": "Faith is taking the first step even when you don't see the whole staircase.",
  "wisdom17Author": "Martin Luther King Jr.",
  "wisdom18": "The seed does not fight the soil. It simply grows.",
  "wisdom19": "Release the need to know how. Trust that the universe knows the way.",
  "wisdom20": "Begin to see yourself as a soul with a body rather than a body with a soul.",
  "wisdom20Author": "Wayne Dyer",
  "wisdom21": "You cannot always control what goes on outside. But you can always control what goes on inside.",
  "wisdom21Author": "Wayne Dyer",
  "wisdom22": "Patience is not passive waiting. It is active trust.",
  "wisdom23": "Everything you need is already within you, waiting to unfold.",
  "wisdom24": "The moon does not fight. It watches. And in watching, it holds everything together.",
  "wisdom25": "Act as if what you intend to manifest in life is already a reality.",
  "wisdom25Author": "Wayne Dyer",
  "wisdom26": "Be still and know.",
  "wisdom27": "Let go of the branches and trust the river.",
  "wisdom28": "The wound is the place where the light enters you.",
  "wisdom28Author": "Rumi",
  "wisdom29": "A ship in a harbor is safe, but that is not what ships are built for.",
  "wisdom29Author": "John A. Shedd",
  "wisdom30": "The universe is always speaking to us. Sending us little messages, causing coincidences and serendipities. The only question is: are we listening?",
  "wisdom30Author": "Nancy Thayer"
}
